      127.2,
      382.44,
      286.68,
      406.64
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No.: Sri Japura/LA/68/NWSD",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      410.72,
      349.01,
      636.56
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7, of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for public purpose. Description of the land to be acquired: Allotments of land, total extent of about 0.0316 Hectare described below, depicted as lot No. 1 in Plan No. CO 9827 and dated 16.05.2019 prepared by Superintendent of survey, situated in the village of Welikada in 514 A, Welikada West Grama Niladari Division in Divisional Secretaries Division of Sri Jayawardhanapura Kotte in Colombo District Western Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      641.12,
      286.66,
      679.52
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: MillagahawaththaAssessment No. 219/1, Rajagiriya Road: Description: Garden, part of a",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      334.64,
      539.57,
      387.92
    ],
    "text": "building; Claimant of the land: Government, Original Claimants: M.A.U. Fernando, Katudeniyawaththa, Bopitiya; Extent: 0.0316 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      392.24,
      539.59,
      445.28
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat on 10th July 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      449.6,
      539.6,
      560.23
    ],
    "text": "And are hereby requested to notify to me in writing with two copies on or before the 08th July 2019 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount and proof the ownership relevant documents and deeds.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
